ck-elements","chapterGroup":"inorganic-chemistry","country":"in","difficulty":"medium","exam":"jee-main","examGroup":"jee","languages":["en","hi"],"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"paperId":"jee-main-2024-online-9th-april-morning-shift","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2024 (Online) 9th April Morning Shift","permalink":"pnumber-of-colourless-lanthanoid-ions-among-the-following-jee-main-chemistry-some-basic-concepts-of-chemistry-ykdwzxssglwg0sbw","question":{"en":{"comprehension":null,"direction":null,"content":"<p>Number of colourless lanthanoid ions among the following is __________.</p> <p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"29.299ex\" height=\"2.48ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -902.3 12950.1 1096.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"45\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-45\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(681,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1270,407.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2223.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(2668.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1214,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4836,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(5280.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"64\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-64\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1339,421.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7573.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(8018,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1158,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(10129.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(10574.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1422,432.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>","options":[],"correct_options":[],"answer":"2","explanation":"<p>The color of lanthanoid ions in solutions is mainly due to the electronic transitions within the 4f subshell. The lanthanoid ions are more likely to be colorless when they have fully filled (with 14 electrons) or completely empty (with 0 electrons) f orbitals because, in these cases, there are no electrons to undergo f-f transitions, and as a result, no absorption of visible light occurs leading to colorlessness.</p>\n\n<p>Let's consider the electronic configurations of the lanthanoid ions provided:</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.031ex\" height=\"2.01ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -877.3 2223.7 888.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"45\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-45\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(681,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1270,407.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: Europium (Eu) has an atomic number of 63. Neutral europium ([Xe]4f<sup>7</sup> 6s^2) loses three electrons to form Eu<sup>3+</sup>, leaving it with an electronic configuration equivalent to [Xe]4f<sup>6</sup>. With 6 electrons in the f orbital, it can undergo f-f transitions, thus it is not colorless.</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.904ex\" height=\"2.016ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -880.3 2167.7 891.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1214,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: Lutetium (Lu) has an atomic number of 71. In its 3+ ionic state, lutetium has lost its 6s and 5d electrons and is left with a completely filled 4f orbital ([Xe] 4f<sup>14</sup>). This configuration cannot allow for any f-f transitions, as there are no available energy levels within the f orbital for an electron to jump to, making Lu<sup>3+</sup> colorless.</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.187ex\" height=\"2.041ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -891.3 2292.7 902.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"64\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-64\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1339,421.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: Neodymium (Nd) has an atomic number of 60. In its 3+ state ([Xe] 4f<sup>3</sup>), it clearly has partially filled f orbitals, which can absorb visible light for f-f transitions, so it is not colorless.</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.778ex\" height=\"2.016ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -880.3 2111.7 891.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1158,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: Lanthanum (La) has an atomic number of 57. In its 3+ ionic state, it has a configuration of [Xe], meaning that its 4f orbital is completely empty. Since there are no electrons in the f orbital to undergo f-f transitions, La<sup>3+</sup> is colorless.</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.375ex\" height=\"2.091ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -902.3 2375.7 924.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1422,432.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: Samarium (Sm) has an atomic number of 62. As a 3+ ion ([Xe] 4f<sup>5</sup>), it too has electrons in the f orbital capable of undergoing f-f transitions, so it is not colorless.</p>\n\n<p>From the analysis, the colorless lanthanoid ions among the ones listed are <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.904ex\" height=\"2.016ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -880.3 2167.7 891.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1214,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.778ex\" height=\"2.016ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -880.3 2111.7 891.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1158,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n\n<p>Therefore, the number of colorless lanthanoid ions among the given options is <strong>2</strong>.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p>निम्न में से रंगहीन लैन्थेनॉयड आयनों की संख्या है : _________ |</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"29.299ex\" height=\"2.48ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -902.3 12950.1 1096.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"45\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-45\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(681,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1270,407.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2223.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(2668.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1214,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4836,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(5280.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"64\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-64\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1339,421.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7573.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(8018,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1158,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(10129.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(10574.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1422,432.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>","options":[],"correct_options":[],"answer":"2","explanation":"<p>विलयनों में लैंथेनॉयड आयनों का रंग मुख्य रूप से 4f उपकोश के भीतर इलेक्ट्रॉनिक संक्रमणों के कारण होता है। लैंथेनॉयड आयनों के रंगहीन होने की अधिक संभावना तब होती है जब उनके पास पूर्णतः भरे हुए (14 इलेक्ट्रॉनों के साथ) या पूर्णतः रिक्त (0 इलेक्ट्रॉनों के साथ) f कक्षक होते हैं क्योंकि इन स्थितियों में, f-f संक्रमण से गुजरने के लिए कोई इलेक्ट्रॉन नहीं होते हैं, और परिणामस्वरूप, दृश्य प्रकाश का कोई अवशोषण नहीं होता है जिससे रंगहीनता उत्पन्न होती है।</p>\n\n<p>आइए प्रदान किए गए लैंथेनॉयड आयनों के इलेक्ट्रॉनिक विन्यासों पर विचार करें:</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.031ex\" height=\"2.01ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -877.3 2223.7 888.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"45\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-45\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(681,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1270,407.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: यूरोपियम (Eu) की परमाणु संख्या 63 है। उदासीन यूरोपियम ([Xe]4f<sup>7</sup> 6s^2) Eu<sup>3+</sup> बनाने के लिए तीन इलेक्ट्रॉन खो देता है, जिससे यह [Xe]4f<sup>6</sup> के समतुल्य इलेक्ट्रॉनिक विन्यास के साथ रह जाता है। f कक्षक में 6 इलेक्ट्रॉनों के साथ, यह f-f संक्रमण से गुजर सकता है, इसलिए यह रंगहीन नहीं है।</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.904ex\" height=\"2.016ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -880.3 2167.7 891.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1214,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: लुटेटियम (Lu) की परमाणु संख्या 71 है। अपनी 3+ आयनिक अवस्था में, लुटेटियम ने अपने 6s और 5d इलेक्ट्रॉन खो दिए हैं और पूर्णतः भरे हुए 4f कक्षक ([Xe] 4f<sup>14</sup>) के साथ रह गया है। यह विन्यास किसी भी f-f संक्रमण की अनुमति नहीं दे सकता है, क्योंकि f कक्षक के भीतर इलेक्ट्रॉन के कूदने के लिए कोई उपलब्ध ऊर्जा स्तर नहीं है, जो Lu<sup>3+</sup> को रंगहीन बनाता है।</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.187ex\" height=\"2.041ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -891.3 2292.7 902.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"64\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-64\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1339,421.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: नियोडिमियम (Nd) की परमाणु संख्या 60 है। अपनी 3+ अवस्था ([Xe] 4f<sup>3</sup>) में, इसके स्पष्ट रूप से आंशिक रूप से भरे हुए f कक्षक हैं, जो f-f संक्रमणों के लिए दृश्य प्रकाश को अवशोषित कर सकते हैं, इसलिए यह रंगहीन नहीं है।</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.778ex\" height=\"2.016ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -880.3 2111.7 891.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1158,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: लैंथेनम (La) की परमाणु संख्या 57 है। अपनी 3+ आयनिक अवस्था में, इसका विन्यास [Xe] है, जिसका अर्थ है कि इसका 4f कक्षक पूर्णतः रिक्त है। चूंकि f कक्षक में f-f संक्रमण से गुजरने के लिए कोई इलेक्ट्रॉन नहीं हैं, La<sup>3+</sup> रंगहीन है।</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.375ex\" height=\"2.091ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -902.3 2375.7 924.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1422,432.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: समेरियम (Sm) की परमाणु संख्या 62 है। 3+ आयन ([Xe] 4f<sup>5</sup>) के रूप में, इसमें भी f कक्षक में इलेक्ट्रॉन हैं जो f-f संक्रमण से गुजरने में सक्षम हैं, इसलिए यह रंगहीन नहीं है।</p>\n\n<p>विश्लेषण से, सूचीबद्ध लैंथेनॉयड आयनों में रंगहीन आयन <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.904ex\" height=\"2.016ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -880.3 2167.7 891.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1214,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> और <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.778ex\" height=\"2.016ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -880.3 2111.7 891.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1158,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> हैं।</p>\n\n<p>इसलिए, दिए गए विकल्पों में रंगहीन लैंथेनॉयड आयनों की संख्या <strong>2</strong> है।</p>"}},"subject":"chemistry","subjectGroup":null,"timeAllotted":120000,"topic":"inner-transition-elements-lanthanoids-and-actinoids","type":"integer","year":2024,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":[],"yearKey":"jee-main-2024-online-9th-april-morning-shift","active":true,"options":[],"correct_options":[],"explanation":"<p>The color of lanthanoid ions in solutions is mainly due to the electronic transitions within the 4f subshell. The lanthanoid ions are more likely to be colorless when they have fully filled (with 14 electrons) or completely empty (with 0 electrons) f orbitals because, in these cases, there are no electrons to undergo f-f transitions, and as a result, no absorption of visible light occurs leading to colorlessness.</p>\n\n<p>Let's consider the electronic configurations of the lanthanoid ions provided:</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.031ex\" height=\"2.01ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -877.3 2223.7 888.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"45\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-45\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(681,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1270,407.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: Europium (Eu) has an atomic number of 63. Neutral europium ([Xe]4f<sup>7</sup> 6s^2) loses three electrons to form Eu<sup>3+</sup>, leaving it with an electronic configuration equivalent to [Xe]4f<sup>6</sup>. With 6 electrons in the f orbital, it can undergo f-f transitions, thus it is not colorless.</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.904ex\" height=\"2.016ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -880.3 2167.7 891.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1214,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: Lutetium (Lu) has an atomic number of 71. In its 3+ ionic state, lutetium has lost its 6s and 5d electrons and is left with a completely filled 4f orbital ([Xe] 4f<sup>14</sup>). This configuration cannot allow for any f-f transitions, as there are no available energy levels within the f orbital for an electron to jump to, making Lu<sup>3+</sup> colorless.</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.187ex\" height=\"2.041ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -891.3 2292.7 902.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4E\"></use><use data-c=\"64\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-64\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1339,421.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: Neodymium (Nd) has an atomic number of 60. In its 3+ state ([Xe] 4f<sup>3</sup>), it clearly has partially filled f orbitals, which can absorb visible light for f-f transitions, so it is not colorless.</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.778ex\" height=\"2.016ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -880.3 2111.7 891.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1158,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: Lanthanum (La) has an atomic number of 57. In its 3+ ionic state, it has a configuration of [Xe], meaning that its 4f orbital is completely empty. Since there are no electrons in the f orbital to undergo f-f transitions, La<sup>3+</sup> is colorless.</p>\n\n<p>- <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.375ex\" height=\"2.091ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -902.3 2375.7 924.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"53\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-53\"></use><use data-c=\"6D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6D\" transform=\"translate(556,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1422,432.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>: Samarium (Sm) has an atomic number of 62. As a 3+ ion ([Xe] 4f<sup>5</sup>), it too has electrons in the f orbital capable of undergoing f-f transitions, so it is not colorless.</p>\n\n<p>From the analysis, the colorless lanthanoid ions among the ones listed are <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.904ex\" height=\"2.016ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -880.3 2167.7 891.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"75\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-75\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1214,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.778ex\" height=\"2.016ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -880.3 2111.7 891.3\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4C\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(625,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1158,410.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n\n<p>Therefore, the number of colorless lanthanoid ions among the given options is <strong>2</strong>.</p>"}]}